    "title": "Williamsburg felon arrested for firing gun around children - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leslie Taylor ,\n4 hours ago A Callaway County convicted felon is arrested for firing a gun near multiple children two nights in a row. The first incident happened late Monday night in Williamsburg. Callaway County deputies were called to the location to investigate a man exiting his home and yelling, then firing shots into the air. Multiple people at the scene, including three children, reported the same thing had happened Tuesday night. One of the children, an 11-year-old girl, said that as she was riding her bike, the man pointed the gun at her. Read full article\n1",
